{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "74079dd7-4bb7-8dd2-b0f5-be8c1a220358",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T10:03:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Beverly Almy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:58:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Merry Christmas Eve, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:58:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hello, pardon me. Good morning. I'm calling about a drain near my house. Can you hear me all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:58:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little faint. You on a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:59:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I am. Pardon me, I'm not sure it's a good connection. I'll talk up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:59:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, go ahead. What's going on with the drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:59:14-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the catch basin on the corner. It's been stopped up with leaves for about a week now, and there's a puddle that just sits there. It never goes down. And it hasn't rained, that's the thing. It's dry out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:59:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so no storm, just a basin that's plugged and water sitting. Got it. What's the address or the corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:59:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 235 Marsh Street, down the Point. The corner right by my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:59:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two thirty-five Marsh Street, the Point. I'm writing that down. Sorry, can you say that last part again? You broke up on me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:59:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] ...Marsh Street, the Point. Two thirty-five. Pardon me, could you hold the phone a little closer? I can barely hear you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:00:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sorry, is that better? I'll talk right into it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:00:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, much better, thank you. Now I can hear you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:00:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So how long has the puddle been there, you said about a week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:00:19-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About a week, yes. I even went out and cleared the leaves off the grate myself, by hand. It helped, it drained for maybe ten minutes, and then it filled right back up. So something is stopped up underneath, I'd think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:00:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a good sign it's more than the top. Leaves packed down in the basin, or the pipe is partly blocked. Good on you for trying, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:00:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'm tired of walking around it, to be honest. Every morning I come out and it's the same big puddle, and it's getting slick. Pardon me, I don't mean to take it out on you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:01:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're fine. It's a fair thing to be fed up about."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:01:05-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I ask you something? Is that a city drain or a state one? Somebody told me the state does some of the roads and I didn't want to call the wrong people."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:01:18-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Marsh Street is a city street, so that basin would be ours. If it turns out to be a state road, we'd pass it along, but you called the right place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:01:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good. Pardon me, I didn't catch that last bit. [crosstalk]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:01:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said it's a city street, so it's ours. You're in the right spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:01:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. That's a relief. Because I've been waiting and waiting, and nobody has come by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:01:49-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'm putting in a work order now: catch basin clogged with leaves at the corner by 235 Marsh Street, standing water, no rain involved, hand-cleared the grate and it refilled. Anything else I should add? Is it blocking the crosswalk or the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:02:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's along the curb at the corner, so people have to step out into the street to get around it. That's what worries me, with the ice coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:02:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note it's at the corner curb and a walking problem. That bumps it up a bit. The crews are running short with the holiday, but it's on the list for the vacuum truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:02:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The vacuum truck, all right. Do you know roughly when?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:02:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Probably the next few working days, maybe early next week with the holiday. Do you want a call back when it's done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:02:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, that would be kind. My number is 401-555-0164."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:02:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-four. Got it. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:02:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Beverly Almy. A-L-M-Y."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:02:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Beverly Almy. Perfect. You're all set, Beverly. If it starts freezing over before they get there, call us back and we'll flag it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:03:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you very much, dear. Pardon me for the trouble, and happy holidays to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:03:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all. You too, take care."
    }
  ],
